raw_text = "~ stage_5_1
sister : brother!! where are you today... you promised me you would bring me to the cementary....
brother : (i can’t tell her about that evil thing)
brother : I... I... I’m sorry okay... i have something important to do... i’ll bring you there one day, but not so soon... it is really important... i promised....
sister : fine...
brother : .....
=> END"
